{
  "id": "166",
  "title": "Little Fatty",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-08-20",
  "synopsis": "A friend of Little Ming's father teases Little Ming calling him a little fatty. Little Ming of course has his way of dealing with this.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/182/d75a0abdeee551054b40d07d21336a88d2839fff.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "小胖子\n\n    一天，小明和爸爸去参加爸爸朋友的婚礼。朋友一见到小明就喊：“哎，小胖子，最近怎么样呀？”\n    小明东看看西看看，假装没有听见。\n    朋友又喊：“哎，小帅哥！”\n    小明一脸天真地看着他，说：“叔叔，你喊我有事吗？”",
    "traditional": "小胖子\n\n    一天，小明和爸爸去參加爸爸朋友的婚禮。朋友一見到小明就喊：“哎，小胖子，最近怎麼樣呀？”\n    小明東看看西看看，假裝沒有聽見。\n    朋友又喊：“哎，小帥哥！”\n    小明一臉天真地看著他，說：“叔叔，你喊我有事嗎？”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Fatty"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，小明和爸爸去参加爸爸朋友的婚礼。",
      "traditional": "一天，小明和爸爸去參加爸爸朋友的婚禮。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān xiǎo míng hé bà ba qù cān jiā bà ba péng you de hūn lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "朋友一见到小明就喊：“哎，小胖子，最近怎么样呀？”",
      "traditional": "朋友一見到小明就喊：“哎，小胖子，最近怎麼樣呀？”",
      "pinyin": "péng you yí jiàn dào xiǎo míng jiù hǎn āi xiǎo pàng zi zuì jìn zěn me yàng ya",
      "english": "One day, Little Ming and his father participated in the wedding ceremony for one of the father's friends."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "As soon as the friend saw Little Ming, he called out: “Hey, little fatty! How are you?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小明东看看西看看，假装没有听见。",
      "traditional": "小明東看看西看看，假裝沒有聽見。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng dōng kàn kan xī kàn kan jiǎ zhuāng méi yǒu tīng jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming looked to the left and looked to the right, pretending that he hadn't heard him."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "朋友又喊：“哎，小帅哥！”",
      "traditional": "朋友又喊：“哎，小帥哥！”",
      "pinyin": "péng you yòu hǎn āi xiǎo shuài gē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The friend called again: “Hey, little handsome guy!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小明一脸天真地看着他，说：“叔叔，你喊我有事吗？”",
      "traditional": "小明一臉天真地看著他，說：“叔叔，你喊我有事嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng yì liǎn tiān zhēn de kàn zhe tā shuō shū shu nǐ hǎn wǒ yǒu shì ma",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
